<title>USA: Wynne SD 9, Ark., won by Sterne Agee.</title>
<headline>Wynne SD 9, Ark., won by Sterne Agee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne Agee &amp; Leach, Inc., said it won $4.200 million of Wynne SD 9, Ark., construction limited tax bonds, Series A, with a net interest cost of 5.4586 percent.</p>
</text>
